---
import lightSvg from '../../assets/diagrams/tasks-ai-token-sources-light.svg?raw';
import darkSvg from '../../assets/diagrams/tasks-ai-token-sources-dark.svg?raw';
import Chart from './Chart.astro';
---

<Chart
  lightSvg={lightSvg}
  darkSvg={darkSvg}
  title="13 of the dark theme's 19 colors come from app tokens; 4 are typed by hand"
  caption="One square for each Chrome color key the dark variant sets."
>
  Unit chart of the 19 Chrome color keys the dark variant sets. 13 take their value from the app's synced tokens: the
  frame, toolbar, omnibox, new tab page, and text and icons. 2 come from the Figma accent file: new-tab links and the
  button background. 4 are constants typed by hand: the inactive frame, the two incognito frames and inactive-tab text.
</Chart>
